OL,3,GNEWSAMan found seriously injured in
OL,4,ALeicester street
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation is under way after a
OL,7,Fman was found seriously injured in a
OL,8,Fstreet in Leicester.
OL,10,FLeicestershire Police said it was
OL,11,Fcalled to Narborough Road at 02:06 BST
OL,12,Fon Tuesday by the East Midlands
OL,13,FAmbulance Service who were in
OL,14,Fattendance at the scene.
OL,16,FThe force said the man had been taken
OL,17,Fto hospital where he remained with
OL,18,Fserious injuries.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
