OL,3,GNEWSAMan found seriously injured in
OL,4,ALeicester street
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice added an investigation to
OL,7,Festablish how the man came to be
OL,8,Finjured was in its "early stages", but
OL,9,Fsaid it was not believed that the man
OL,10,Fhad been stabbed.
